## 7. Training Portal

### What the boss wants
- Training capability
- Job application AND training in one portal

### 💡 How to implement

After an agent is hired and signs their contract, they unlock the **Training Portal**:

```
/dashboard/training
├── Training Modules (video + text lessons)
├── Module Quizzes (reuse exam engine)
├── Progress Tracker (% complete)
