## 13. 🧠 MY OWN RECOMMENDATIONS (Bonus Features)

These are features your boss didn't explicitly ask for, but would **massively** improve the platform:

### A. Applicant Self-Service Dashboard Enhancement
Let applicants see their own pipeline stage visually:
```
Applied ──●── Screening ──○── Exam ──○── Interview ──○── Hired
           ↑ You are here
```

### B. Bulk Actions
HR should be able to select 20 applicants → "Advance All to Exam" or "Reject All" or "Send Mass Email" in one click.

### C. Notification Center (In-App)
Replace the basic bell icon with a full notification center:
- "Your interview is in 2 hours"
- "New applicant requires screening"
- "Contract awaiting signature"

### D. Dark/Light Mode for Admin Panel
The admin panel is dark-only right now. Some HR staff may prefer light mode during long work sessions.

### E. Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)
For admin accounts — add TOTP (Google Authenticator) support. This is a security must-have for a platform handling PII.

### F. Applicant Duplicate Detection
Before creating a new applicant, check if the email already exists. Show: "You've already applied. Want to check your status instead?"

### G. Automated Email Sequences
When someone applies → auto-send "We received your application" email. When they pass screening → auto-send "You're invited to take the exam." No manual action needed.

